1          /*===============================================================================
2           * sdtm_epoch_bug_trtepochdefault.sas - Bug regression: TRTEPOCH= documented default
3           *===============================================================================
4           * Macro under test : %sdtm_epoch
5           * Expected         : TRTEPOCH= is documented as optional with default "TREATMENT",
6           *                    so a call without TRTEPOCH= maps the boundary to TREATMENT
7           * Status           : OPEN 2026-11-09 - signature has trtepoch= with no default
8           * Original defect  : Header says *Param(Opt) : (TRTEPOCH="TREATMENT") but
9           *                    %macro declares trtepoch=, so the call aborts with
10          *                    "ERROR: Parameter TRTEPOCH= not specified."
11          * Fix              : either set trtepoch="TREATMENT" in the %macro statement,
12          *                    or change the header to Param(Req) with no default
13          * Test passes when  the defect is fixed (run_all then reports FIXED).
14          *============================================================================*/
